# RELIC HEAT (GEAR.md G9; Interference `carried`): a relic worn is a found-tech
# signature the network reads, and the reads app names it under the trace, so a
# player can learn why a region warms. The lock worn, the world clock moved an
# hour, the reads app open.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/relic_heat.tour --seed=1 --hour=10 --weather=clear:0 --fit=glide_wing,mod_lock
coast calm
place spawn
wait 0.4
hour 12
wait 0.6
tap pause
await app:pause 3
choose reads
tap use
await app:reads 3
wait 0.6
shot 01-what-you-carry-hums with app:reads
